msgstr "One burrow, your HQ across the field and almost nothing in between: the path is yours to draw."

msgid "La Cour de l'usine"
msgstr "The Factory Yard"

msgid "Deux portes crachent des machines blindées. Un même labyrinthe doit les ralentir toutes."
msgstr "Two gates spit out armored machines. A single maze has to slow them all down."

