msgstr "No path: your towers and buildings make the maze, and every rock you mine opens a way through."

msgid "[color=%s]Niveau libre : pas de chemin, vos tours font le labyrinthe.[/color]"
msgstr "[color=%s]Free level: no path, your towers make the maze.[/color]"

msgid "Carte libre"
msgstr "Free map"

msgid "Pas de chemin tracé : les monstres partent des terriers et contournent vos tours jusqu'au QG."
