msgstr "Daily challenge rules to replay levels you have already won, at the chosen difficulty. Each active mutator earns one infinite star on victory, up to %d per level: they buy tower specializations in Upgrades."

msgid "✦  Mutateurs"
msgstr "✦  Mutators"

msgid "Règles du défi du jour sur les niveaux déjà gagnés, contre des étoiles infinies."
msgstr "Daily challenge rules on levels already won, for infinite stars."
msgid "Banshee"
msgstr "Banshee"

msgid "Spectre hurlant qui flotte au-dessus des tombes et file droit vers la base."
msgstr "Shrieking ghost that floats above the graves and flies straight for the base."

msgid "Revenant"
msgstr "Revenant"

msgid "Mort en suaire, invisible pour les tours sauf près d'une tour qui détecte. Abattu, il se relève une fois."
msgstr "Shrouded corpse, invisible to towers except near a detecting tower. Struck down, it rises once."

msgid "Tunnelier"
msgstr "Borer"

msgid "Foreuse blindée qui plonge régulièrement sous le chemin, hors d'atteinte des tours, et ressort plus loin."
msgstr "Armored drill that regularly dives under the path, out of the towers' reach, and comes out further on."

msgid "Saboteur"
msgstr "Saboteur"

msgid "Ingénieur à la pince coupante qui éteint en passant la tour la plus proche."
msgstr "Engineer with wire cutters who shuts down the nearest tower as he passes."

